  "bodyHash": "674da26c6a815c2f",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner-slim.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\nImmersive Armors（沉浸盔甲）为游戏添加了一系列兼容原版且独特的盔甲套装。与千篇一律的复制粘贴式盔甲不同，Immersive Armors 专注于视觉增强的盔甲，部分盔甲还带有披风或自定义模型。大多数盔甲提供独家特效，如狂怒模式、反弹、尖刺、神圣庇护等。合成配方已正确注册到原版的合成书（Recipe Book）中。附魔、修复和染色功能均按预期工作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>40 种新盔甲物品，且数量还在增加！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors:armor&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的合成表图片\"></p>\n\n<h1>木制盔甲</h1>\n<p>我不敢说你的情况，但我已经厌倦了被骷髅狙击。这种原始但有效的盔甲提供了相当不错的箭矢和爆炸保护。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髅盔甲</h1>\n<p>曾经想过把你的敌人变成盔甲吗？可能没有，但这是一款轻量级的骷髅盔甲。它让你移动得更快，甚至拥有凋零盔甲的效果。骷髅不再攻击你！它会伤害所有试图接触你的东西！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神圣盔甲</h1>\n<p>想要脱颖而出吗？看这里，一套华丽的金红色盔甲。你可以随意给布料上色。除了外观漂亮并提供极高的防护外，全套神圣盔甲每分钟可以完全阻挡一次攻击！</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型盔甲</h1>\n<p>高护甲值，增加的韧性，代价是几乎丧失机动性。这套盔甲旨在粉碎最强大的敌人。</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史莱姆盔甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道，这看起来不像盔甲。但相信我，它很管用。攻击你的敌人会被弹开，爆炸也不会造成太大伤害！不过……穿上它你可能会闻到一股味道……</p>\n<img width=\"300\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>战士盔甲</h1>\n<p>这不仅仅是维京盔甲，穿上它，你就是维京人！每损失一点生命值，斧头伤害和总伤害都会增加。进入狂怒模式，在残酷的近战战斗中消灭你的敌人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>法袍盔甲</h1>\n<p>毛茸茸、可染色的羊毛盔甲。注入了烈焰棒，可以对试图攻击你的人造成火焰伤害！哦，而且它也是防火的。因为烈焰棒。科学！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽朋克盔甲</h1>\n<p>旋转的齿轮、黄铜、指南针、时钟，以及大量的烟雾。让我向你介绍最复杂的盔甲套装——蒸汽朋克盔甲。头盔配备了敌对雷达系统，潜行时激活。胸甲提供了一个增强版的 GUI，让你再也不必担心错过时间！护腿配备了二段跳，靴子则通过集成的蒸汽喷射器完全防止跌落伤害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶盔甲</h1>\n<p>利用守卫者的尖刺为你所用！这款带刺盔甲会对攻击者造成尖刺伤害。虽然坚硬的岩石会减缓你的速度，但它也提供深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>视频评测！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size:16px;text-align:center;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\">\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品都已集成到原版合成书（以及 JEI 等模组）中。骨块、铁块、海晶砂粒、羊毛、史莱姆、活塞、皮革盔甲、法袍、凋灵骷髅头颅和木块是解锁这些配方所需的物品。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成配方图片\"></p>\n\n<h1>翻译</h1>\n<p>\nImmersive Armors 已通过机器翻译支持多种语言，但由于质量往往较差，欢迎加入我们的翻译团队\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>。\n<br>\n欢迎对糟糕的翻译投反对票并提交你自己的版本。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不兼容性</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模组（盔甲将使用丑陋的回退模型）</p>\n<p>试图以低透明度渲染盔甲的模组</p>\n\n<h1>集成</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-humans\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile Humans&description=Adds Hostile Humans with structures into your world&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Hostile Humans\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&description=Mysterious, long-forgotten portals scattered across the Overworld.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Gateways\">\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜欢这个颜色？某些盔甲套装是可染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n截图中的着色器是 Nostalgia Shader（怀旧着色器）\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=4c21d6df030e3633f0c59639a39f2560\" alt=\"页面哈希，便于页面部署。\"></p>",
